{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213480","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521348001:0":{"text":"Did you hear anything about Marco? Is... is he okay?","source_cn":"你们打听到马尔科的消息了吗？他……他还好吗？<key:...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9C58F06E2E783F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521348002:0":{"text":"He was hurt in battle. He's still recovering at the camp.","source_cn":"他在战场上受了伤，现在还在军营里接受治疗。<key:d...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC648A3B7FA34A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521348003:0":{"text":"He wrote you a letter. Asked us to bring it to you.","source_cn":"他写了一封信，托我们转交给你。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1BA41707FE76433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521348004:0":{"text":"Oh, thank goodness he's okay... Let me see it.","source_cn":"没事就好，没事就好……我看看他的信。<key:dial...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41FE80AB4D495BBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521348005:0":{"text":"Fufu takes Marco's letter and quickly begins reading.","source_cn":"芙接过马尔科写的信，连忙看了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9451842F810CFBBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521348006:0":{"text":"Oh my goodness... Marco... I'm finally going to see him!","source_cn":"天哪……马尔科……我终于可以见到他了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4FA2CFEF8251DA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521348007:0":{"text":"What did he say?","source_cn":"他写了什么？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71ED01BDD2D201F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521348008:0":{"text":"He said... even though the Wildborn and Halians are sworn enemies, he's willing to try. For me.","source_cn":"他说……他说虽然雅库伯尔人和呼临人互相敌视，但他愿意为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C7E8F5BD3A2D7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521348009:0":{"text":"He asked me to meet him. Ten days from now, at the <style=\"highlight\">Primal Shrine</style>. He said... maybe we don't have to end up like the Hunting Goddess and the Halian general. Maybe our story can end differently!","source_cn":"所以十天之后，他会<style=highlight>到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6687DCA44C7E9B1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1521348009":{"text":"He asked me to meet him. Ten days from now, at the <style=\"highlight\">Primal Shrine</style>. He said... maybe we don't have to end up like the Hunting Goddess and the Halian general. Maybe our story can end differently!","source_cn":"所以十天之后，他会<style=highlight>到狩猎神殿前与我相见</style>……也许我们不会像狩猎神和呼临统帅那样，也许我们可以迎来不一样的结局……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6687DCA44C7E9B1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521348010:0":{"text":"Of course I'm going!","source_cn":"当然，我当然会去！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B23637D35D84B0D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Of course I'm going!","female":"Of course I'm going!","variant_male_record_index":"185086","variant_female_record_index":"185087","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521348011:0":{"text":"Just thinking about seeing him again in a few days, I...","source_cn":"一想到再过几天就可以见到他，我简直……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF216E4D03510CDDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521348012:0":{"text":"No! You can't go!","source_cn":"——不行！姐姐你不能去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F88A354B000F3F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521348013:0":{"text":"Twitch?! Where did you even come from?","source_cn":"扭耳？！你……你从哪冒出来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF539952C26CC3DFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521348014:0":{"text":"Not telling! But you're not going to see that awful Halian!","source_cn":"我才不告诉你！反正你不要想和那个坏呼临人见面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8E124ED8465749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521348015:1":{"text":"I'm telling Mom and Dad! They'll stop you for sure!","source_cn":"我现在就去告诉阿爹阿娘！让他们阻止你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FFE575D76B59E38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521348016:1":{"text":"Twitch! Wait!","source_cn":"扭耳——扭耳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC9D966AD92906D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521348017:0":{"text":"If he really tells your parents, they might not let you go.","source_cn":"如果他真的告诉你阿爹阿娘，你可能没办法去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B79E0B5A22AFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521348018:0":{"text":"I know...","source_cn":"我知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04451DF46D8852E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521348019:0":{"text":"But I'm still going.","source_cn":"但我一定要去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8A8B45D112392B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521348020:0":{"text":"Marco had the courage to take the first step... I have to do the same for him.","source_cn":"马尔科愿意为我迈出第一步……那我就不能辜负他的心意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD08DBD7E7899D705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521348021:0":{"text":"Would you come with me? If you could be there as witnesses, I think it would mean a lot to him.","source_cn":"到时你们要来吗？如果你们能为我们见证，我想马尔科也一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C58A433791441E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1521348021":{"text":"Would you come with me? If you could be there as witnesses, I think it would mean a lot to him.","source_cn":"到时你们要来吗？如果你们能为我们见证，我想马尔科也一定会高兴的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C58A433791441E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521348022:0":{"text":"I'll go with Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"我会陪<style=stress><player_na...","statu